 point to a Republican advantage of roughly 15 points.\n\nThe one countervailing signal is Governor Andy Beshear's rising popularity and the attention his potential 2028 candidacy has drawn, which suggests Democrats have a credible in-state standard-bearer. That supports a modest shift toward Democrats, but the structural lean remains firmly Republican, making this a likely rather than safe Republican race.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0468, "margin": -15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.1024, "margin": -14.0}]}